 er extremem Metal in seiner rohesten Form.\nFreut euch auf einen brachiale
 n Mix aus Old School Death Metal\, Thrash Metal\, Death Doom Punk\, Grindc
 ore\, Goregrind und Hardcore.\n\nMit dabei sind:\nHaemorrhage (ES)\nhttp:/
 /www.facebook.com/HaemorrhageGore\nhttps://haemorrhage-spain.bandcamp.com\
 n-\nHypnos (CZ)\nhttp://www.facebook.com/HypnosCZ\n-\nTeething (ES)\nhttp:
 //www.facebook.com/teethingband\nhttps://teething.bandcamp.com\n-\nCryptic
  Brood (DE)\nhttp://www.facebook.com/CrypticBrood\nhttps://crypticbrood.ba
 ndcamp.com\n-\nDistaste (AUT)\nhttp://www.facebook.com/distastegrind\nhttp
 s://distastegrind.bandcamp.com\n-\nArroganz (DE)\nhttp://www.facebook.com/
 arroganzgermany\nhttps://arroganz.bandcamp.com\n-\nLost (DE)\nhttp://www.f
 acebook.com/Lostgrindcore\nhttps://lostgrindcore.bandcamp.com\n-\nAezid (D
 E)\nhttp://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61575842859733\nhttps://aezidmu
 sic665.bandcamp.com\n-\nNecromorph (DE)\nhttp://www.facebook.com/necromorp
 hband\n\n-\nTicketspreis: VVK - 45\,00 € (Early Bird 40€) / AK - 50€
